---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/site/PageIntro.astro';
import { COMPANY_NAME } from '../data/company';
import { PARTY_GAME_NAME } from '../data/products';

const LAST_UPDATED = '2026-10-20';
---

<Layout
  title={`Terms of Use | ${COMPANY_NAME}`}
  description="Terms of use for the ByteLite LLC website: informational content, research statements, product status, commerce controls and proprietary technology."
  path="/terms"
>
  <PageIntro eyebrow="Legal" heading="Terms of Use">
    <p class="small-print">Last updated <time datetime={LAST_UPDATED}>20 October 2026</time>.</p>
  </PageIntro>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose legal">
      <h2>An informational website</h2>
      <p>
        This website provides information about {COMPANY_NAME}, its research and its products. It is
        not a store. By using it you agree to these terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Research statements are not product claims</h2>
      <p>
        Research described on this website is ongoing. A research objective is an objective, not a
        claim of existing capability. A status such as "internally tested" means what its definition
        on the <a href="/research/milestones#status-definitions">milestones page</a> says, and nothing
        more. Nothing on this website is a claim of independent verification, production readiness or
        commercial availability unless it says so explicitly.
      </p>

      <h2>No purchases, reservations or subscriptions</h2>
      <p>
        No payment, reservation, preorder or subscription can be made through this website today.
        Checkout is switched off in this website's configuration. Before any of that changes, the specific terms will be published, and you will be
        asked to accept them before anything can be charged.
      </p>
      <p>
        {PARTY_GAME_NAME} is planned as a physical product for adults aged 18 or over. Under the United
        States Federal Trade Commission's Mail, Internet, or Telephone Order Merchandise Rule, a seller
        that takes payment must have a reasonable basis to ship within the stated time, or within 30 days
        if no time is stated, and must have a process for obtaining consent to delays or issuing refunds.
        {COMPANY_NAME} will not accept a paid preorder until it can meet those requirements.
      </p>
      <p>
        If the Founder Supporter Pack is ever offered, it will be a purchase from {COMPANY_NAME}, a
        for-profit company. It will not be a charitable donation, it will not be tax deductible, and it
        will provide no equity, repayment rights, product ownership, product access or control over
        development. Its contents are listed on the <a href="/support">Supporter Pack page</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>No offer of securities</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing on this website is an offer to sell, or a solicitation of an offer to buy, any
        security or investment. General business and investor inquiries can be sent through the
        contact form. They create no obligation on either side.
      </p>

      <h2>Proprietary technology</h2>
      <p>
        {COMPANY_NAME}'s research methods and systems are proprietary. Descriptions on this website
        explain objectives, status and how results are judged. They do not disclose implementation,
        and nothing on this website grants a license to use, copy or build on {COMPANY_NAME}'s
        technology. Any use requires a separate written agreement.
      </p>

      <h2>Status can change</h2>
      <p>
        Statuses reflect the best information available on the date shown. {COMPANY_NAME} may change,
        delay or stop any research program or product.
      </p>

      <h2>No warranties</h2>
      <p>
        This website is provided as it is, without warranties of any kind. {COMPANY_NAME} works to keep
        it accurate but does not guarantee that every statement is complete or current.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Montana, USA, without regard to conflict-of-law principles.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms can be sent through the <a href="/contact">contact form</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
